# Grabbed by the Ghoulies (4D530053), Nova and Thor. DRAFT by lane.routeprep,
# 2026-09-26, not played. One file: New Game with a fresh slot is the same
# path whether or not an older save exists [guess: a slot list may then
# highlight the used slot first; A still starts a game in it].
#
# Evidence: ghoul311 hands-off 240 s (0-0-c-1790370153-ghoul311-3053340,
# Nova, ~2.8 s per frame): f06 a candle and "Press START" (~15 s), then the
# storybook attract with "Press START" on every page (f10-f87, to 240 s),
# including comic panels of Cooper and a Ghoulie. So START is taken almost
# from boot. Nothing past it is on disk.
#
# Controls [recalled]: the left stick moves Cooper and the RIGHT stick
# attacks in the direction pushed (Rare's scheme for this game), so the play
# pattern works both sticks.
wait 20
shot boot20                 # expect "Press START" [seen f06]
press START
wait 8
shot after-title            # [guess] the storybook menu: New Game first
mark booted
press A                     # [guess] New Game
wait 8
shot slot                   # OPEN: a save-slot choice
press A
wait 8
shot after-slot
press A                     # [guess] confirm / name / difficulty default
wait 10
shot intro
repeat 10 {
    press A                 # [guess] advance the opening comic pages
    wait 6
    shot intro-a
}
mark gameplay               # [guess] placeholder: move to the first frame with Cooper in a room with ghoulies
repeat forever {
    axis LY min
    axis RX max
    wait 0.5
    axis RX mid
    axis RY min
    wait 0.5
    axis RY mid
    axis LY mid
    axis LX max
    axis RX min
    wait 0.5
    axis RX mid
    axis RY max
    wait 0.5
    axis RY mid
    axis LX min
    wait 1
    axis LX mid
}
